            crm:P190_has_symbolic_content "meaning unknown | footwear, especially hose; knitted stocking | footwear, esp. hose; knitted stocking | footwear, esp. hose; knitted stocking, but clausa is of unknown meaning | hose, here short (Latham Word-List s.v. caliga) | hose; stocking (Latham Word-List s.v. caliga), here short | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.) | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.), here for women | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, here also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.) | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.) (in pairs) | an article of clothing for the leg; sometimes reaching down only to the ankle as a legging or gaiter, sometimes also covering the foot like a long stocking (OED s.v. hose n.), here knit | hose (q.v.), knit" ;
